    "summary": "Use it in either player's Fight phase or the opponent's Shooting phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick a **CRYPTEK INFANTRY** unit of yours that is a target of at least 1 of those attacks. For the rest of the phase, its models gain an invulnerable save of:\n\n- 5+ if the unit is **NECRON WARRIORS**\n- 4+ if the unit is **IMMORTALS**",
